{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"plan\": \"line沿着“想靠近—怕添负担—渐敢承认—愿意陪伴—接受未知”推进；feel逐珠拆成短碎片。“话卡在嘴边”与尾声“终于说完”前后呼应，“舍不得”由甜意渐渐带上酸楚；摇荡从未成形、持续托举到最后定住。\",\n  \"sections\": [\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S01\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"他忽然很想靠近，却怕自己的需要成了负担。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"很想靠近\", \"成了负担\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"炽热\",\n          \"from\": [\"S01-1\", \"S01-2\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"两下亮和弦\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"来得突然\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"烟花升起\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"直冲高处\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"光点细碎\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"缓缓飘落\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"落了还没稳\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"悬在水面上\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"船歌摇荡未成形\", \"bead\": \"S01-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"他只敢露出一点喜欢，还不知下次能否坦白。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"一点喜欢\", \"能否坦白\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"悬着\",\n          \"from\": [\"S01-2\", \"S01-3\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"话还没出口\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"沉默几秒\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"想了很久\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"清楚要说什么\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"一开口就不同\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"怕关系变了\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"格外谨慎\", \"bead\": \"S01-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"刚踏上船板\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"木板微晃\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"水波荡开\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"身体一失重\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"脚下还不稳\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"有的已经轻摇\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"有的先悬在空中\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"还没安稳交给水浪\", \"bead\": \"S01-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S02\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"对方没有退开，他才慢慢放松，也想再靠近一点。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"没有退开\", \"慢慢放松\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"安心\",\n          \"from\": [\"S02-1\", \"S02-2\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"两条旋律贴近\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"耳边轻声耳语\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"肩挨着肩\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"呼吸挨得很近\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"体温融在一起\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"相识已久\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"安静坐着\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"不用找话题\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"偶尔望来一眼\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"沉默不紧张\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"夏末潮湿微风\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"温热裹着皮肤\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"黏黏的触感\", \"bead\": \"S02-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"歌声还没浮出\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"4–5\"},\n            {\"text\": \"左手像心跳\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"4–5\"},\n            {\"text\": \"一下一下地摇\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"4–5\"},\n            {\"text\": \"没完没了的水浪\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"4–5\"},\n            {\"text\": \"脚下不用踩实\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"放开对重力的控制\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"身体交给船底\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"温柔地托着\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"舒服地漂着\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"暂时不急靠岸\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"水流不停\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"时间也在走\", \"bead\": \"S02-B2\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"他怕太急弄坏自在，也怕这样的时刻很快过去。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"弄坏自在\", \"很快过去\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"不安\",\n          \"from\": [\"S02-2\", \"S02-3\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"收着的歌声\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"12–14\"},\n            {\"text\": \"忽然往上涌\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"12–14\"},\n            {\"text\": \"热切了一些\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"12–14\"},\n            {\"text\": \"呼吸跟着变了\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"12–14\"},\n            {\"text\": \"没有冲向高潮\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"14–16\"},\n            {\"text\": \"轻轻呼出口气\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"14–16\"},\n            {\"text\": \"重新柔和下来\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"14–16\"},\n            {\"text\": \"短暂落稳\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"14–16\"},\n            {\"text\": \"又漂起一点\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"14–16\"},\n            {\"text\": \"心事还留余地\", \"bead\": \"S02-B3\", \"bars\": \"14–16\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"柔软的落音\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"像一根软刺\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"像一句肯定\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"心里有点惆怅\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"眼前的好还在\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"鼻子一酸\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"还没失去\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"已经舍不得\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"盼这一刻慢点\", \"bead\": \"S02-B4\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S03\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"他难得不想以后，只想舒服地待在这份亲近里。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"不想以后\", \"这份亲近\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"亲密\",\n          \"from\": [\"S03-1\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"歌声退远\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"只剩流动\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"一阵阵盘旋\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"水波摇曳\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"身体漂浮\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"暂时不去哪里\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"停在那句话里\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"有点陶醉\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"有点走神\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"沉默不尴尬\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"身体还在这里\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"心慢慢漂远\", \"bead\": \"S03-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"想说喜欢、想问对方，却还没开口念头就淡了。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"想说喜欢\", \"念头就淡了\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"悬着\",\n          \"from\": [\"S03-2\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"短促几声\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"20–21\"},\n            {\"text\": \"带点急切\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"20–21\"},\n            {\"text\": \"急于表达的念头\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"20–21\"},\n            {\"text\": \"水面露个头\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"20–21\"},\n            {\"text\": \"很快沉下去\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"20–21\"},\n            {\"text\": \"没变成倾诉\", \"bead\": \"S03-B2\", \"bars\": \"20–21\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"水波还在晃\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"流动被牵住\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"暗流往下拖\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"绕远又滞留\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"声音挂半途\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"被风吹碎的倒影\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"粼粼闪烁\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"拼不起来\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"谈话碰上结\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"顺畅里有阻力\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"20–22\"},\n            {\"text\": \"没走向悲剧\", \"bead\": \"S03-B3\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        }\n      ]\n    },\n    {\n      \"sec\": \"S04\",\n      \"rows\": [\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"熟悉的亲近又让他欢喜，也想起上回没说的话。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"熟悉的亲近\", \"没说的话\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"欢喜\",\n          \"from\": [\"S04-1\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"熟悉歌声回来\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"两道声线贴近\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"耳边低语\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"比上回更华丽\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"也更迫切\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"细密花腔\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"水面光斑\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"晃得睁不开眼\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"讲往事先带笑\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"语速慢慢变了\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"忍不住再说一遍\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"},\n            {\"text\": \"折回来补细节\", \"bead\": \"S04-B1\", \"bars\": \"\"}\n          ]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"line\",\n          \"text\": \"他想把话全说出，又怕对方为难、失去自在。\",\n          \"keys\": [\"全说出\", \"失去自在\"],\n          \"emotion\": \"不安\",\n          \"from\": [\"S04-2\", \"S04-3\"]\n        },\n        {\n          \"kind\": \"feel\",\n          \"items\": [\n            {\"text\": \"高处长颤音\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"约32\"},\n            {\"text\": \"最后一道金光\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"约32\"},\n            {\"text\": \"亮得刺眼\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"约32\"},\n            {\"text\": \"情绪烧到最热\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"约32\"},\n            {\"text\": \"想说出深情\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"约32\"},\n            {\"text\": \"喉头发颤\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"约32\"},\n            {\"text\": \"几乎哽咽\", \"bead\": \"S04-B2\", \"bars\": \"约32\"},\n            {\"